    "This 2025 Sprinter AWD 170 build in our El Capitan Tier is built for long-haul comfort and legit off-grid capability—power, water, climate control, and storage all engineered to keep you moving and staying out longer. With a high-capacity Battle Born system, heated tanks, an electric greywater dump, a tiled indoor shower, and a fully dialed kitchen (including induction + water purification), it’s a refined home base that’s still ready to get dusty."
